  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$|z|+|z-1| a$ is complex number\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{c}\r\n|z|+|-(1-z)| \\quad|a|=|-a| \\\\\r\n|z|+|1-z| \\quad\\{\\because|a|=|-a|\\} \\\\\r\n|z|+|1-z| \\geq|z+1-z| \\\\\r\n|z|+|1-z| \\geq|1| \\\\\r\n|z|+|1-z| \\geq 1 \\\\\r\n|z|+|-(z-1)| \\geq 1 \\\\\r\n|z|+|z-1| \\geq 1\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\r\nMinimum value of $|z|+|z-1|=1$",
    "image": null
